    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a first of its kind procedure in Pakistan, doctors at Aga Khan University Hospital successfully placed a heart rhythm monitoring device - an implantable cardioverter defibrillator (ICD) - in a 14-year-old girl from Balochistan.",
